<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_bcdf54a8-fde4-4c84-b7b1-fc4f32384392"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_d2bd79ea-ebfe-4ea7-81ed-22140d959d50" id="def.billoflading"><b><i>bill
of lading</i></b></defterm> means a bill of lading (including a received for
shipment bill of lading) which is capable of transfer:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a8fee9bc-37fc-4899-b63f-b734a51f9df4" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by endorsement, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4917a08e-91de-48e3-a0ce-e7ce6c149511" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">as a bearer bill, by delivery without
endorsement.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_73470449-056a-40da-80cc-1f0fd251dd2f"
id="def.contractofcarriage"><b><i>contract of carriage</i></b></defterm>, in
relation to a sea-carriage document, means:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0fbb0d59-d089-4dfb-8d42-7d50e17a8a12" id="sec.5-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a bill of lading or a sea
waybill&#8212;the contract of carriage contained in, or evidenced by, the
document, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_aac944f1-a708-4086-bdca-6ca01ae58fee" id="sec.5-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a ship&#8217;s delivery
order&#8212;the contract of carriage in association with which the order is
given.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_567dc5c9-2bae-40fc-b349-75c70a010998" id="def.datamessage"><b><i>data
message</i></b></defterm> means information generated, stored or communicated
by electronic, optical or analogous means including, but not limited to,
electronic data interchange, electronic mail, telegram, telex and
telecopy.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1d4d1a77-a6b1-4626-8f02-d43ec8bd400e"
id="def.goods"><b><i>goods</i></b></defterm>, in relation to a sea-carriage
document, means the goods to which the document relates.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_45c0c803-4111-44e4-93cb-8c862633c45f"
id="def.identification"><b><i>identification</i></b></defterm>, in relation to
the identification of a person in a sea-carriage document, includes the
identification of the person by a description which allows for the
person&#8217;s identity to be varied, in accordance with the document, after
its issue.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c72b5600-1af5-4a66-a808-5b22fede1f61"
id="def.lawfulholder"><b><i>lawful holder</i></b></defterm>, in relation to a
bill of lading, means a person who:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_798cad36-180d-4ee6-b61f-1d482ea0fd07" id="sec.5-para1.a-oc.3">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">has come into possession of the bill, in good
faith, as the consignee of the goods, by virtue of being identified in the
bill, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_363c9a5f-327b-4973-ab3a-32e33a0ea2f1" id="sec.5-para1.b-oc.3">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">has come into possession of the bill, in good
faith, as a result of the completion, by delivery of the bill:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_496593b8-44bc-4a51-850b-4bd7b71c4947" id="sec.5-para1.b-oc.3-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">of any endorsement of the bill,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bc14ea1b-39ae-497f-8a31-3a54587008c5"
id="sec.5-para1.b-oc.3-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a bearer bill&#8212;of any other
transfer of the bill, or</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_16db0423-f533-4d4b-940c-b6775e295291" id="sec.5-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">would be the lawful holder of the bill under
paragraph (a) or (b) had not the person come into possession of the bill as
the result of a transaction effected at a time when possession of the bill no
longer gave a right (as against the carrier) to possession of the
goods.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_9470a31b-e8f9-4e44-9642-51ed475819b9"
id="def.seacarriagedocument"><b><i>sea-carriage document</i></b></defterm>
means a bill of lading, a sea waybill or a ship&#8217;s delivery
order.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_54e03055-61ee-487b-8af0-b290bf15443e" id="def.seawaybill"><b><i>sea
waybill</i></b></defterm> means a document other than a bill of lading
which:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e30060e3-8e4a-4c4d-beca-aa42967509c5" id="sec.5-para1.a-oc.4">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is issued by the carrier of the goods,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ab759abc-c195-4ea1-ac11-66c843806a2e" id="sec.5-para1.b-oc.4">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is a receipt for the goods,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cd045f38-3cef-4e09-81fb-7efa05e56187" id="sec.5-para1.c-oc.2">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">contains or evidences a contract for the carriage
of the goods by sea, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_439ef14e-33e8-4904-982e-7bb4e9041943" id="sec.5-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">identifies the person to whom delivery of the
goods is to be made by the carrier in accordance with the
contract.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_51e26574-f7b9-4b27-ae26-6776addbd248"
id="def.shipsdeliveryorder"><b><i>ship&#8217;s delivery
order</i></b></defterm> means a document other than a bill of lading or a sea
waybill which:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_584d181c-6165-4cd7-b62f-460dd84930c5" id="sec.5-para1.a-oc.5">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is given in association with a contract for the
carriage of goods by sea including those to which the document relates,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_03d9bb96-c516-4655-89b0-25ab220fdd2a" id="sec.5-para1.b-oc.5">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">contains an undertaking by the carrier to deliver
the goods to which the document relates to a person identified in the
document.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
