<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_ca9034c8-dc63-4944-9501-062aeb0a3524"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Electronic and computerised sea-carriage
documents</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ac7cd15a-bcea-498a-b358-de54227e9208"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to this section, this Act applies:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f1bbf2f8-f479-464c-9d77-70a6dce2a698" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in relation to a sea-carriage document in the
form of a data message&#8212;in the same way as it applies in relation to a
written sea-carriage document, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5ad2a576-a23f-453c-9615-6997b7234eb5" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in relation to the communication of a
sea-carriage document by means of a data message&#8212;in the same way as it
applies in relation to the communication of a sea-carriage document by other
means.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_83dc1787-d876-4452-8af3-adf4a83c0aaa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act applies under subsection (1) with
necessary changes and in accordance with procedures agreed between the parties
to the contract of carriage.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1e11c6cd-91da-4e04-9422-12e0115172ea"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting the generality of subsection
(2), in this Act, in the application of the following terms to a sea-carriage
document in the form of a data message, or to the communication of a
sea-carriage document by means of a data message:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ebd123c6-8170-43f0-b317-e308ece43a40"
id="sec.6-def.delivery"><b><i>delivery</i></b></defterm> includes any form of
communication which constitutes delivery under the terms of the contract of
carriage.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_f5ea7d4f-6f60-455a-8289-6782358ca95e"
id="sec.6-def.endorsement"><b><i>endorsement</i></b></defterm> includes any
form of authorisation which constitutes endorsement under the terms of the
contract of carriage.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5be16185-ac5d-4aaa-9b54-3a50cd3e4171"
id="sec.6-def.possession"><b><i>possession</i></b></defterm>, in relation to
the document, includes being in receipt of the document in any manner which
constitutes possession under the terms of the contract of
carriage.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_60a119e5-5374-4f7e-8322-a3d32554db6b"
id="sec.6-def.signed"><b><i>signed</i></b></defterm> includes authentication
in any manner which constitutes signing under the terms of the contract of
carriage.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fdd12720-201c-42c0-93a2-a9cab3d156a9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_91d7ac8f-8561-4773-9dd3-d6026f1fe5a9"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Application where goods have ceased to exist, or cannot be
identified</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without prejudice to the operation of section 8
(4) or 12, nothing in this Act precludes its operation in relation to a
sea-carriage document where the goods:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a11fe815-8ccd-43fe-b70d-fcf2c8f93906" id="sec.7-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">cease to exist after the issue of the document,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_84aac81f-ac10-4019-a085-a0145f8afb73" id="sec.7-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">cannot be identified (whether because they are
mixed with other goods, or for any other reason).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_22ad4a51-9713-47b4-af6e-68b2a3d103d5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_5dca40e1-972d-47d4-a43f-c101b1a85dca"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Rights under contracts of carriage</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a3e9f519-9cc3-4450-99f6-65772c1eaf83"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_0bcd529a-a8d9-4d54-bdce-dd60946a0dc1"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Transfer of rights</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ec4c1c49-0421-4802-ace9-3edcfd7aff15"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">All rights under the contract of carriage in
relation to which a sea-carriage document is given are transferred to:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dbffa52e-7e86-4e53-830b-ff4a314d4cd0" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a bill of lading&#8212;each
successive lawful holder of the bill, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3400540b-c840-4751-9e77-d08a257283d9" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a sea waybill&#8212;the person
(not being an original party to the contract) to whom delivery of the goods is
to be made by the carrier in accordance with the contract,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_50124b48-2de4-4a18-a792-8e57b2768f41" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a ship&#8217;s delivery
order&#8212;the person to whom delivery of the goods is to be made in
accordance with the order.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3edd29e4-ce49-48d3-a1c2-23122b401293"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Rights in a contract of carriage transferred to a
person under subsection (1) vest in that person as if the person had been an
original party to the contract.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_37e3d037-08d3-42bf-8049-a9102746d94a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Rights in a contract of carriage in relation to
which a ship&#8217;s delivery order is given are transferred under subsection
(1):</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c772a8dd-fa71-43fd-af2a-cf2e32179bc2" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">subject to the terms of the order,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_73b2a1dc-eb88-4203-a95a-505f5852ef47" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">only in respect of the goods to which the order
relates.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6391c6f6-94f1-4d5c-9a0d-a9085b5dd806"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where a person becomes the lawful holder of a
bill of lading when possession of the bill no longer gives a right (as against
the carrier) to possession of the goods, no rights are transferred to that
person under subsection (1) unless the person becomes the lawful holder of the
bill:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3db38481-93bb-4d73-ad0a-c30f213e9557" id="sec.8-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by virtue of a transaction effected under any
contractual or other arrangement made before the possession of the bill ceased
to give such a right to possession, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_63596bf1-953a-4377-adbc-b0ea25a6f119" id="sec.8-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">as a result of the re-endorsement of the bill
following rejection to that person by another person of goods or documents
delivered to the other person under any contractual or other arrangement made
before the possession of the bill ceased to give such a right to
possession.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_06c6c354-98d8-49da-936b-967c62448a6a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where, in relation to a sea-carriage
document:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_21a2690d-02a5-4c69-8727-3aa02d005d06" id="sec.8-ssec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a person with any interest or right in relation
to the goods sustains loss or damage in consequence of a breach of the
contract of carriage, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_adef6f48-7d03-4e2c-933d-d6033855c12d" id="sec.8-ssec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">subsection (1) operates to transfer the rights in
that contract to another person,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">the person to whom the rights in the contract are
transferred is entitled to exercise those rights for the benefit of the person
who sustained the loss or damage to the same extent that they would be able to
be exercised if they were vested in that person.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7ba796f9-a3f2-4e94-97d1-605a99f0e13f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, a reference to a <defterm
type="definition" guid="_086e4c26-141e-409c-b7d0-d5be31eb86e7"
id="sec.8-def.contractofcarriage"><b><i>contract of
carriage</i></b></defterm>, in relation to the transfer of rights under the
contract, is to be taken to be a reference to the contract as varied by any
variation of which the transferee has notice at the time of the
transfer.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e2c926c2-782d-4acf-a6e6-f581c8a05956"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_35f972a7-9330-4fe2-b6c3-ed8b2bda87fe"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Extinguishment of previous rights</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fdf56d83-d623-460a-b240-907d60802450"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where section 8 operates in relation to a bill of
lading to transfer rights under the contract of carriage, the transfer
extinguishes any entitlement to those rights which derives from:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f0493b0b-365b-4e16-adc9-358aa3d9ebd8" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a person&#8217;s having been an original party to
the contract of carriage, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_60c4c7f7-959d-42f5-8c52-e19810481392" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the previous operation of that
section.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1f931be2-3d1a-488a-a5ae-ec2800331c9c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where section 8 operates in relation to a sea
waybill or ship&#8217;s delivery order to transfer rights under the relevant
contract of carriage:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ee1025f9-a3dd-4f06-81af-51862b0c7afc" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the transfer extinguishes any entitlement to
those rights which derives from the previous operation of that section,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b169b6f2-f88e-495b-9447-dccf8bbe18c1" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a sea waybill&#8212;the transfer
is without prejudice to any rights which derive from a person&#8217;s having
been an original party to the contract, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8288fa07-4d1a-46fe-a70e-fdd4cf58d38c" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in the case of a ship&#8217;s delivery
order&#8212;the transfer is without prejudice to any rights under the contract
other than rights derived from the previous operation of that
section.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8e011f0b-176d-4060-a27b-cb346413f3be"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_c16c0856-1570-42fd-bd8b-1be351b987f1"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Liabilities under contracts of carriage</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ef0e942d-1f63-4027-b1bf-3957f8de0695"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_86809e5b-8923-4e6d-9165-46350a2007a8"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Transfer of liabilities</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_554a1150-baf7-4e5a-bda2-7cf73de284eb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section applies to a person where rights in
the contract of carriage in relation to a sea-carriage document are
transferred to the person under section 8 and:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_401d874b-8170-46cf-a384-2de6ddcf3f90" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">before those rights are transferred, the person
demands or takes delivery from the carrier of any of the goods,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cb793cdd-6de2-4dc5-97f4-56a3ffa3bb26" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">after those rights are transferred, the person
demands or takes delivery from the carrier of any of the goods,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8539d12b-74e8-4f23-a0d0-03b30de96e82" id="sec.10-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person makes a claim under the contract
against the carrier in respect of any of the goods.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f25db67b-69d4-4ee4-9150-760531c0c1a3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person to whom this section applies is subject
to the liabilities under the contract as if the person had been an original
party to the contract.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7eaecdd6-e20f-456c-88d5-9f67f03a38c7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person to whom subsection (1) (a) applies
becomes subject to the liabilities under the contract under subsection (2) at
the time the rights in the contract are transferred to the
person.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aa09f473-a4e7-481c-8424-e05037be9bd1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, a reference to a <defterm
type="definition" guid="_19ba0a2e-857d-4329-bb4f-37ec4e0fc89b"
id="sec.10-def.contractofcarriage"><b><i>contract of
carriage</i></b></defterm>, in relation to a person who becomes subject to a
liability under the contract by virtue of this section, is to be taken to be a
reference to the contract as varied by any variation of which the person has
notice at the time of becoming subject to the liability.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5393224e-79dc-430f-bb14-0e29e6695282"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_80900337-72a3-452c-8951-c2d1217ecddc"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Liability of original parties</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 10 does not operate so as to prejudice
the liability under a contract of carriage of any original party to the
contract.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_319f0ed5-ceab-4ba8-ad0a-80bf0f2843ac"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 4</b></no><heading guid="_69c9508f-f52a-4a0c-9626-578e21873226"
id="pt.4-he"><b>Evidence</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a4a2b71f-2b0f-430e-b48d-da098f658072"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_80687873-97bd-4c52-8695-9caafdeed253"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Shipment under bills of lading</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2b65c033-9a11-4740-988c-907ba8f413ee"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section applies in relation to a bill of
lading which:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0d7646c8-1975-41dd-8611-728ff33d0ea9" id="sec.12-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">represents goods to have been shipped, or
received for shipment, on board a vessel, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8a38828b-0c88-4a63-afd0-3334d2bdd94a" id="sec.12-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is signed:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6d487414-e6cd-4255-be16-94f6f7d59e8a"
id="sec.12-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by the master of the vessel,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_faad043d-1b02-4b7e-a759-426fad70ffdb"
id="sec.12-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by another person with the express, implied or
apparent authority of the carrier to sign bills of
lading.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a7aa06e7-76b2-48a6-887a-f90e1b8addd5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A bill of lading to which this section applies is
prima facie evidence as against the carrier, in favour of the shipper, of the
shipment of the goods or, in the case of a received for shipment bill of
lading, of their receipt for shipment.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc6806de-e220-4de8-a0a0-75707f781275"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A bill of lading to which this section applies is
conclusive evidence as against the carrier, in favour of a lawful holder of
the bill, of the shipment of the goods or, in the case of a received for
shipment bill of lading, of their receipt of shipment.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0948994a-6058-4d30-b4dd-ee03416c5425"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 5</b></no><heading guid="_7ad9d217-7c5b-47ea-aa31-be0cdfb6385f"
id="pt.5-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc04aa7b-004c-4795-b558-c500e33e04da"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_3dd0936b-b65a-488e-8b20-36a02348179d"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_997147dc-2c2a-40b0-b0ba-eaa8701665ed"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading guid="_fceecc97-5b2e-4bdf-933f-3f34e630daaa"
id="sec.14-he"><b>Review of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_80d13b84-e188-4f5f-bba2-ce170a0ca37a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to review this Act to determine
whether the policy objectives of the Act remain valid and whether the terms of
the Act remain appropriate for securing those
objectives.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c03c8f66-e1ac-4684-8305-d6a4ae947aeb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The review is to be undertaken as soon as
possible after the period of 5 years from the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9c41d7b9-aabd-4d4e-9ac5-4f4dfe5407f0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report on the outcome of the review is to be
